/E (Lifestyle Portfolio Strategy: We understand that your investment need and objectives are dynamic and change as per your changing life stage. The Lifestyle Portfolio Strategy addresses the same by providing you with the right mix between Equity and Debt, based on the duration of your investment. Under this strategy, depending on the duration of your policy, Total Premium Paid subject to deduction of charges will be allocated between the 3 investment funds as per a pre-defined strategy.)
